    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d498">

                <pb facs="0483" n="473" sameAs="frus:frus1949v09/pg473"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.24/1–749: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Ambassador in the United Kingdom</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Douglas</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-01-07T18:00:00-05:00">January 7, 1949—6
                            p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>82. For Depts info only, have you (Deptel 4777 Dec 28) been able ascertain
                    whether tanks earmarked for scrapping or WE programs?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lovett</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
